            "verseId": "1SA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 20.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.10+DEU.18.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 18.10-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.25.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cam 25.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno onoŋo Camuel doŋ oto woko. Jo Icrael ducu gukumo pire ci guyike i Rama i gaŋŋe kikome. Caulo yam koŋ onoŋo oryemo lukor tipo ki megi jogi woko ki i lobone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Piliciti gucokke ci gutoŋo gonygi i Cunem, Caulo bene ocoko jo Icrael ducu ci gin gutoŋo gonygi i Gilboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Caulo oneno mony pa jo Piliciti, ci obedo ki lworo, cwinye ocako myel matek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 27.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Caulo openyo dog Rwot, Rwot pe odokke iye lok mo, kadi wa, ki lek-gu, nyo ki Urim, nyo ki lok pa lunebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Caulo owaco bot luricce ni, “Koŋ wuyennnya dako mo ma lakor tipo, wek acit bote, acipeny doge.” Luticce guwacce ni, “Lakor tipo tye wa i En-dor.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caulo oloko kite woko mapat, pien oruko ginaruka mapat, ci ocako wot ki jone aryo, Gucito guo bot dakonu dyewor. Caulo owaco bote ni, “Ber ikorra tipo, Mi jokki okella dano mo ma abituco nyiŋe boti.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dako-nu ogamo doge ni, “Iŋeyo gin ma Caulo otiyo, kit ma oryemo kwede lukor tipo ki megi jogi-gu woko ki i lobone, Ci piŋo in dok ibino ka cika ki owic lamak kwona wek ineka woko?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Caulo okwoŋo kwoŋ bo te ki nyir; Rwot kun wacci, “Macalo Rwot tye makwo-ni, pe can mo bipoto i komi pi lok man,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci dako-nu ogamo ni, “Abikelo aŋa boti?” Caulo ogamo ni, “Kella Camuel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dako-nu oneno: kom Camuel, ci odaŋŋe ki dwan matek, owaco bot Caulo ni, “Ibwola piŋo? In i Caulo kikome.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka owaco bot dako ni, “Pe ibed ki lworo, Ineno kom aŋo kaa?” Dako ogamo ni, “Aneno tipo mo obebino kun katti a ki piny i ŋom.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caulo dok openyo ni, “Kite nen niŋniŋ mono?” Ogamo ni, “Dano ma oti aye obebino-ni; oumo kome woko ki jor.” Ci Caulo oniaŋ ni en aye Camuel kikome, okulo wiye piny oryebbe i nyime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Camuel ocako lok ki Caulo ni, “Piŋo iyela kit man, idwoka dok woko?” Caulo ogamo ni, “Can aye tye odiŋa matek; pien jo Piliciti gitye ka lweny i koma, Lubaŋa bene otenya woko ata, Pe doŋ dokka iye kit lok mo, kadi wa lok pa lunebi, kadi wa lek-gu doŋ pe. En aye omiyo alwoŋi wek ititta gin ma myero atim.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Camuel ogamo ni, “Piŋo dok ipenyo an ma Rwot doŋ oweki woko-ni, odoko lamerokki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cam 15.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot doŋ otimo i komi kit ma yam ocika kwede ci an bene atito lokke boti wa con ca, Rwot doŋ oyeco kerri woko okwanyo ki i ciŋi, ci doŋ otyeko miyone woko bot lawoti, en aye Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.3+1SA.15.4+1SA.15.5+1SA.15.6+1SA.15.7+1SA.15.8+1SA.15.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cam 15.3-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In yam pe iworo dog Rwot, pe icobo kiniga magwa pa Rwot i kom jo Amalek; en gin mumivo Rwot tye ka timi kit man i kare-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot bimiyo jo Icrael ki-in bene i ciŋ jo Piliciti; di ki in ki awobeni wubibedo kacel kweda. Rwot bimiyo mony pa jo Icrael i ciŋ jo Piliciti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caulo otugi poto woko piny i ŋom, ci obuto piny Iibat pi lworo ma omake matek pi lok pa Camuel. Tipo kome oto woko lirut, pien onoŋo pe ocamo cam mo i dyeceŋ ki dyewor meno ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dako-nu ocito bot Caulo cok, oneno kome doŋ obaŋŋe woko, ci owaco bote ni, “Nen ba ladit, an doŋ awinyo dogi, adyero pi kwona woko pi timo gin ma iwacca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In bene, ladit, doŋ iwiny doga. Wek koŋ aket latin cam mo i nyimi icam, ka wek dok ilim kero pi wotwu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En okwero woko kun wacci, “Pe abicam.” Ento luticce gubako doggi bote kacel ki dako-nu, ci owinyo lokgi, ocako a malo ki i ŋom obedo i wi kitanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dako-nu onoŋo tye ki latin roya mo ma ocwe i ode. Ocako nekone woko oyotoyot, ka ojobo moko kwon, onywaŋo, otedo mugati ma tobi pe iye. ",
